{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSwitchItem"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Layouts","level":2,"text":"Layouts"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component can be rendered as two different layouts:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the component has a leading indicator, a label and optional texts, and an optional trailing decorative icon"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"inverse","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": like the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" layout but with a trailing switch indicator and a leading optional decorative icon"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Indicator-states","level":2,"text":"Indicator states"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch indicator has two available states set as a boolean property that determines whether the toggle is on or off."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Particular-cases","level":2,"text":"Particular cases"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look and feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In that case if the component displayed an icon, this icon will be replaced automatically by an error icon."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition, the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" can be in read only mode, i.e. the user cannot interact with the component yet but this component must not be considered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as disabled.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and optional texts and a custom switch trait.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","level":2,"text":"Forbidden by design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a read only component.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both a read only and a disabled component."}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var isOn: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    MISOSwitchItem(LocalizedStringKey(\"notifications_setting\"), bundle: Bundle.module, isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but in read only mode (user cannot interact yet, but not disabled).","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label and a description text.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, description: \"The Beatles\")","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a label, a description and a tinted icon.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a raw (non-tinted) image.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"il_someImage\"), renderingMode: .original),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ Flip the icon for RTL layouts using MISOImage.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","                                   flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ If on error, add an error message to help user understand the error context","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   isError: true,","                   errorText: \"Something wrong\",","                   hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but disabled.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\", isOn: $isOn)","        .disabled(true)","","    \/\/ Never disable a read only or an error-related switch as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Rich-text","text":"Rich text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can only be used for error messages."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.14.0","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-1lrtn","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-88707","doc:\/\/MISOCo